; Clear the ALL/EXCEPT stage
;
; Sets AllStage to 0. That byte is 0 for a normal command, 1 after ALL
; (#R$82D2) and 2 after EXCEPT (#R$82BA); it is cleared at the start of every
; parse (#R$7585) and when the parser leaves the EXCEPT nouns.
;
; O:A 0
@label=ClearAllStage
c$785F XOR A         ;
 $7860 LD ($B719),A  ; AllStage
 $7863 RET           ;
